              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayikwakha, bahlale kwelinye; abayikutshala, badle esinye, ngokuba njengezinsuku zomuthi ziyakuba njalo izinsuku zabantu bami, nabakhethiweyo bami bayakuthokozela umsebenzi wezandla zabo.",
