          "text": "Impisi newundlu kuyakudla ndawonye, ingonyama idle utshani njengenkunzi, nothuli lube yinyama yenyoka. Aziyikwenza okubi, zingachithi kuyo yonke intaba yami engcwele,” usho uJehova.",
